This is a Unity 6 2D project.

General Rules:
- Use modern Unity APIs (avoid deprecated methods like FindObjectOfType)
- Do not rewrite entire systems unless explicitly asked
- Prefer minimal, safe, drop-in changes
- Preserve existing architecture and naming conventions
- Avoid breaking references between scripts
- Keep UI logic separate from gameplay logic

When modifying systems:
- Check related scripts before making changes
- Especially for combat, inventory, equipment, tooltips, and UI systems
- Do not introduce unnecessary complexity

When responding:
- Clearly state what files were modified
- Explain why the change was made
- Keep solutions simple and maintainable

Scoped edits (when the user narrows the request):
- If they say things like **update text**, **wording only**, **description only**, **update icon**, **tooltip only**, or otherwise name a single kind of change, **only edit that part**. Do not replace whole YAML blocks, list entries, or components just to update one field.
- For Unity `.asset` / `.prefab` YAML: do not overwrite `icon`, `guid`, `fileID`, or other serialized fields unless they explicitly asked to change those. Read the **current** file before patching; never paste an outdated block that would wipe Inspector values.
- If the scope is unclear, ask—or change only what they named (e.g. “text” = description/copy only).